 "remarks": "WELCOME TO BEACHCOMBER CONDOMINIUMS! SPACIOUS ONE-BEDROOM, ONE-BATH CONDO OFFERING 796 SQUARE FEET OF LIVING SPACE IN STAMFORD'S DESIRABLE COVE NEIGHBORHOOD. THIS UNIT FEATURES A GENEROUSLY SIZED LIVING ROOM, LARGE BEDROOM, HARDWOOD FLOORING IN THE HALLWAY, AMPLE NATURAL LIGHT AND A FUNCTIONAL KITCHEN WITH PLENTY OF CABINET SPACE. BEAUTIFUL BRICK COMPLEX WITH LANDSCAPED GROUNDS AND ATTRACTIVE WALKWAYS. CONVENIENTLY LOCATED NEAR COVE ISLAND PARK, BEACHES, SHOPPING, RESTAURANTS, PUBLIC TRANSPORTATION, I-95 AND DOWNTOWN STAMFORD. A GREAT OPPORTUNITY TO ADD YOUR PERSONAL TOUCHES AND BUILD EQUITY. DON'T MISS THIS OPPORTUNITY TO ENJOY COASTAL LIVING IN STAMFORD! SUBJECT TO PROBATE COURT APPROVAL.",
